description         Cross-platform inference and training accelerator for ONNX models.
long_description    ONNX Runtime runs machine learning models in the ONNX format. This port builds \
                    the shared library with the default CPU execution provider and the CoreML \
                    execution provider.
homepage            https://onnxruntime.ai
supported_archs     x86_64 arm64

# GitHub's archives of the release return 404, so the tarball comes from the overlay's mirror.
master_sites        https://github.com/Tatsh/tatsh-overlay/releases/download/__distfiles__/:main
distfiles           ${distname}${extract.suffix}:main

